# # /FAIR-course-UT/
#
# Namespace for the resources of the FAIR Principles and FAIRification
# Process course of the University of Twente, the Netherlands.
# https://canvas.utwente.nl/courses/9711
#
# The redirects for a course edition are added while that edition runs and
# removed once it ends, because the student repositories they point at are
# not maintained afterwards. Therefore this file carries no redirect rules
# between editions, and the namespace remains reserved for the next one.
#
